            "sid": "JER 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji nijo ilagho BWANA orenighorieghe ingelo Mzuri Zedekia oremdumirieghe Pashuri mwana wa Malkia na mkohani Zefania mwana wa Maaseia ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kukotie BWANA kwa wundu ghodu, kwa kukaia Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni waawuyabonya wuda nesi, kewada BWANA uchadibonyera mabonyo ghake gha mashiniko, upate kudiinjikia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
